# text = But , when the defence come on , then I see the plan plainer ; for , says the counsellor for Compeyson , ' My lord and gentlemen , here you has afore you , side by side , two persons as your eyes can separate wide ; one , the younger , well brought up , who will be spoke to as such ; one , the elder , ill brought up , who will be spoke to as such ; one , the younger , seldom if ever seen in these here transactions , and only suspected ; t'other , the elder , always seen in 'em and always wi'his guilt brought home .
